# What the command line (`wh`) puts in front of the person at the Mac. Its own words, replies and errors stay
# English in the code; only what the app shows in its windows because a script asked is here.

## The question before closing a terminal

# A sentence the close question adds when a script asked for the close (`wh close`), so the person knows
# why the sheet appeared. The rest of the question is the usual one.
control-close-asked = The command line asked to close it.
